[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、魔物討伐も終わって、\nいよいよ最終レースだー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that the monster hunting is over, it's time for the final race!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "数々のレースを制して、\n勝ち残ったのはこの方々です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After winning race after race, these are the competitors who made it through!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？\u3000なんであんたたちが！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Why are you guys here too?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここでビーッグなサプライズだあああ！！！\n最終レースには我らが王、ララ様と……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here's a MAJORLY big surprise! Our queen, Queen Lara, will be participating in the final race, along with...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "元錬金党の党首であるクリセルダさんも参加されます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda, the former leader of the Polar Night Alchemists!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "初めからそう決まってたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was this decided from the beginning?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミーケとディオーナに推されましたの。\n王自らが汗を流しグランプリを盛り上げるのです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke and Diona convinced me to participate. The queen herself shall work up a sweat to make this Grand Prix exciting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は元の楽しみがなくなってしまったからよ。\nその分、直接あなたたちと遊ぼうと思ったの。ふふ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My original fun got taken away from me. So I thought I'd play with you all directly instead. Hehe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "またなんか企んでるんじゃないでしょうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're not plotting something again, are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさか。隠し玉なんてないわ。\n本当の真剣勝負を、全力で楽しみましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course not. I don't have any tricks up my sleeve. Let's enjoy a real, serious competition with everything we've got."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰が勝つか分からない。手に汗を握る、最高のスリルと\n興奮を観客たちに味わわせてあげるのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No one knows who'll win. Let's give the audience the ultimate thrill and excitement that'll keep them on the edge of their seats."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふん、なに言ってるのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph, what are you talking about?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "勝つのは、私よ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm the one who's going to win!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうなんの小細工もしないわ！\n追い求めるのは速さのみ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No more tricks or schemes! I'm going for pure speed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私の名を世に知らしめる。\n\u3000最初に参加する時はそんなことを思っていたけれど）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted to make a name for myself when I first entered this competition..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今は何よりも、この時間を楽しんでいる。\n\u3000もうすぐ終わってしまうのが惜しいくらいに）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But now, more than anything, I'm just enjoying this moment. It's almost sad that it'll be over soon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あと少し……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just a little more...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララキン鶏！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara Kingdom chicken!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "負けないよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I won't lose!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私だって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Neither will I!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "王の威光をご覧なさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Witness the queen's majesty!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "悪くないわ……この感覚！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not bad... this feeling!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "負けたくない……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't want to lose...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンチュ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Antje"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ッ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いつか終わりが来るっていうなら、\n\u3000全力で楽しまなきゃ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If everything has to end eventually, then I've got to enjoy it with everything I have."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "残すは最後の直線！\u3000みんな横並びだー！\n果たして誰が１位になるのか……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Only the final stretch left! Everyone's neck and neck! Who will take first place?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（出し切るのよ！\u3000全力を！\n\u3000そして楽しむの！\u3000今しかないこの時を！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Give it everything! Full power! And enjoy it! This moment that only exists right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゴーーーーールッ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Goal!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そうして、私たちの“今”が終わりを告げた）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And so, our 'now' came to an end."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（寂しくなんかないわ。だって、すぐに\n\u3000次の“今”が始まる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I'm not sad. Because the next 'now' will begin right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そういうものでしょ？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's just how it is, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]